   "type": "text",
   "x": 854,
   "y": 1062,
   "width": 574.08,
   "height": 143.75,
   "text": "A paramedic scans the QR on Asha's phone.\nAny 2 of her 3 trusted people (husband, doctor,\nsister) must approve. One alone can't unlock it.\nThen blood group, allergies & medicines open\nfor 24 hours — and every look is logged.",
   "originalText": "A paramedic scans the QR on Asha's phone.\nAny 2 of her 3 trusted people (husband, doctor,\nsister) must approve. One alone can't unlock it.\nThen blood group, allergies & medicines open\nfor 24 hours — and every look is logged.",
